NAME
    mv - rename an entry

SYNOPSIS
    mv OLD NEW

DESCRIPTION
    Rename OLD to NEW within the working directory. Both are names, not
    paths.

    Moving an entry to another directory is refused (EXDEV) until the
    filesystem can do it safely (LIMITATIONS 2.22): to move a file, copy
    it with cp(1) and remove the original with rm(1). A directory cannot
    be moved to another directory at all yet.

SEE ALSO
    cp(1), rm(1)
